id: pain-resistant
name: Pain Resistant
talentCategory: threshold
prerequisites: 2+ Threshold Talents
description: >
  You are well-accustomed to pain, and you show no visible signs of your discomfort.
text: >
  Pain Resistant: You are well-accustomed to pain, and you show no visible signs of your discomfort.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Threshold Talents
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you receive Damage from an Opponent’s Attacking Maneuver, increase your Soak Value and Damage Reduction by 1(bT) until the end of the Combat Round.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round, 2/Encounter]: If an Opponent knocks you through a Health Threshold, that Opponent does not gain Bonus Momentum, and they cannot trigger any of their effects that trigger when you are knocked through a Health Threshold.

---

# (1) Damage from an Opponent's Attacking Maneuver (the `opponent-damage` Moment): Pain Resistant (a mark) - Soak Value and
# Damage Reduction 1(bT) - till the Round ends. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/opponent-damage, 1/round, effect 1]
gain("pain-resistant-mark");
expires("pain-resistant-mark", round);

[passive]
# (2) An Opponent's attack about to knock you through: asked of whoever plays you, once a Round and twice an Encounter - no
# Bonus Momentum for them, and nothing of theirs answering it (chat.mjs painDenies; combat.mjs announceThreshold).
allow painResistant.deny;
